@startuml deployment_diagram
title Solar Energy Prediction System - Deployment Diagram

node "Client Device" {
  [Web Browser]
}

node "Backend Server\n(localhost:8000)" {
  [FastAPI Application] as API
  [Simulation Engine] as Engine
  [Weather Services] as Weather
}

node "Frontend Server\n(localhost:8501)" {
  [Streamlit Server] as StreamlitServer
}

cloud "External Services" {
  [Open-Meteo API] as OpenMeteo
}

[Web Browser] --> StreamlitServer : HTTP :8501
StreamlitServer --> API : REST :8000
API --> Engine
API --> Weather
Weather --> OpenMeteo : HTTPS

note right of API
  Endpoints:
  - POST /simulate
  - POST /forecast/yearly
  - GET /health
end note

@enduml

note right of OpenMeteo
  Free tier limits:
  • 10,000 calls/day
  • No API key required
end note

@enduml
